  ["write backup file to the Drive folder `03 גיבויי איפוס` via Cloud Function, await write acknowledgment, and only then delete. If the backup write fails or times out, abort the deletion entirely and surface a silent message.", "write the backup file to the flat Drive folder `3 גיבויים` via Cloud Function, waiting up to 90 seconds for Drive; if Drive fails or does not finish in time, or the backup exceeds 30MB, write it to Cloud Storage under backups/{class_id}/ (readable by the class teacher), record backup_channel ('drive' or 'storage') and proceed; only then delete. If both Drive and Storage fail, abort the deletion entirely and surface the silent message. A daily server job copies Storage-only backups to the Drive folder, updates the audit entry's link and keeps the Storage copy; the dashboard marks resets whose backup has not reached Drive yet. There is no automatic restore from a backup."],
